---
description: Mandatory repo rules for every agent. Read AGENTS.md first.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any change. It is mandatory.

Short version:

- RFC numbers are global across every branch. Run `git fetch --prune origin && make rfc SLUG=...`. Never pick a number yourself.
- Branch from a freshly fetched `origin/main`.
- `make check` must pass before you push. New host modules ship with tests.
- Never merge your own PR, force-push branches you didn't create, touch auth/CORS/token code without an RFC, or change deploy/DNS settings.
